---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import SanctuaryCta from "../components/SanctuaryCta.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Our Vision & Philosophy"
  description="Why NPconscious exists as A Sanctuary for Young Minds: combining emotional safety, curiosity-first learning, and guidance across Mathematics, Computer Science, and free Career Guidance."
>
  <!-- Hero Section: Warm Beige -->
  <section class="surface-beige px-5 pt-12 pb-16 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 lg:px-8 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24">
    <div class="container-feature">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
        <!-- Left Hero Content -->
        <div class="space-y-6 lg:col-span-7">
          <h1 class="display-h1" data-hero-reveal>
            Building Thinkers,<br />
            Not Just Test-Takers
          </h1>

          <p class="max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]" data-hero-reveal>
            NPconscious began by helping students rediscover mathematics. Today, we are growing into <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">A Sanctuary for Young Minds</strong>, a student-friendly space for Mathematics, Computer Science, and free Career Guidance.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3.5 pt-1" data-hero-reveal>
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/918011236456?text=Hi%20Nikhil%2C%20I%20would%20love%20to%20connect%20and%20learn%20more%20about%20NPconscious."
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-pill-primary"
            >
              <span>Connect with Founder</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <!--email_off-->
            <a
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=admin@npconscious.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-pill-secondary"
            >
              <span>Email Founder</span>
            </a>
            <!--/email_off-->
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-muted)] pt-1" data-hero-reveal>
            Nikhil Parag · Information Science Engineer · Ex-Bhanzu, Airbnb, Concentrix
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Visual -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-hero-reveal>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[24px] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-white">
            <img
              src="/vision.webp"
              alt="NPconscious learner-focused vision"
              class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Educational Manifesto (White Surface) -->
  <section class="surface-white section-pad border-y border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
    <div class="container-feature space-y-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="section-h2">Why "Conscious" Learning?</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          When teaching is reduced to memorizing steps for an exam, curiosity fades. When we listen before advising and build visual clarity first, learning stays for life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="divide-y divide-[var(--border-subtle)] border-y border-[var(--border-subtle)]">
        <article class="grid gap-4 py-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] lg:col-span-4">
            The Real Source of Learning Fear
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)] lg:col-span-8">
            Children do not dislike thinking; they dislike feeling confused and judged. When a learner is handed a formula or rule without discovering <em>why</em> it works, their mind treats it as an arbitrary burden. That pressure creates anxiety that lasts into adulthood.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="grid gap-4 py-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] lg:col-span-4">
            Visual Intuition Before Symbols
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)] lg:col-span-8">
            Human beings are visual pattern recognizers. Whether exploring algebra, geometry, or computational thinking, we translate abstract ideas into concrete models and clear analogies. Once a student can <em>see</em> how an idea works, symbols document what they already understand.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="grid gap-4 py-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] lg:col-span-4">
            Emotional Safety in the Classroom
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)] lg:col-span-8">
            No student learns deeply while feeling humiliated or rushed. Our mentors treat questions and mistakes as windows into how a student reasons, and our free Career Guidance ensures learners can reach out even before they know what they need.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Personal Letter from the Founder (Beige Surface) -->
  <section class="surface-beige section-pad">
    <div class="container-reading">
      <div class="sanctuary-card p-7 sm:p-12 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="feature-h3 !text-2xl sm:!text-3xl !font-semibold">
          Why I Started NPconscious
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
          <p>
            Throughout school and college, I observed capable students lose interest in learning because it was presented as an unforgiving gauntlet of rules and timed drills. The beauty of reasoning was lost under the weight of memorization.
          </p>
          <p>
            After working across tech and education organizations like Bhanzu, Airbnb, and Concentrix, I saw that lasting learning happens when a student feels safe to say: "I don’t understand this yet; can we look at it another way?"
          </p>
          <p>
            That is why NPconscious was founded in January 2026. As we grow into <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">A Sanctuary for Young Minds</strong>, that same approach now guides everything we do across Mathematics, Computer Science, and free Career Guidance. We are not becoming less focused on education; we are becoming more relevant to more students.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]">Nikhil Parag</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]">Founder &amp; Academic Director, NPconscious</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
            <!--email_off-->
            <a
              href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=admin@npconscious.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-pill-secondary !py-2.5 !px-5 !text-xs"
            >
              <span>Email Founder</span>
            </a>
            <!--/email_off-->
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/918011236456?text=Hi%20Nikhil%2C%20I%20read%20your%20letter%20on%20the%20NPconscious%20site%20and%20would%20love%20to%20connect."
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-pill-primary !py-2.5 !px-5 !text-xs"
            >
              <span>Message Nikhil on WhatsApp</span>
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SanctuaryCta
    heading="Join a Sanctuary Built Around Student Curiosity"
    description="Whether you want to explore Mathematics, share interest in Computer Science, or sit down for free Career Guidance, start with a conversation."
    primaryLabel="Chat on WhatsApp"
    secondaryLabel="Go to Admission & Intake"
    secondaryHref="/admission"
  />
</MainLayout>
